  "description": "X2 Studios & X1 One-Bedroom Apartment to Let – 75 North Circular Road, Dublin\r\n\r\nA selection of accommodation is currently available at **75 North Circular Road, Dublin**, in a convenient and well-connected location close to Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\n**Currently available:**\r\n\r\n• **2 Studio Units – €1,550 per month**\r\n• **1 One-Bedroom Apartment – €1,700 per month**\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally situated on North Circular Road, offering easy access to Dublin City Centre and a wide range of local amenities, shops, cafés and public transport links. The location is particularly convenient for anyone looking to live within easy reach of the city centre while still being based in an established residential area.\r\n\r\nEach unit provides comfortable private accommodation within the building , subject to the individual unit and agreed occupancy arrangements.\r\n\r\n**Licence Agreement**\r\n\r\nPlease note that the accommodation is being offered on a **licence-to-occupy basis under a Licence Agreement, rather than being offered by the provider as a standard residential tenancy agreement.** Prospective occupants will be provided with a copy of the Licence Agreement and its terms for review before entering into the arrangement.\r\n\r\nShared Facilities\r\n\r\nPlease note that certain facilities within the building are shared between occupants, including the washing machine and dryer.\r\n\r\nTo ensure that all occupants have fair and convenient access to these facilities, designated laundry days are allocated to each unit/occupant. Each occupant will therefore have specified days on which they can use the shared washing and drying facilities. Further details regarding the schedule will be provided prior to moving in.\r\n\r\nEnquiries & Application\r\n\r\nIf you are interested, **please make initial contact by email** and include a brief introduction about yourself, including your current circumstances, intended move-in date, how long you are hoping to stay, and which unit you are interested in.\r\n\r\nOnce your initial enquiry has been reviewed, I will get back to you with any further questions and information regarding viewings and the application process.\r\n\r\nApplicants who wish to proceed will be required to provide:\r\n\r\n• **Two written references**\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease do not send supporting documentation with your initial enquiry unless requested. Further details will be provided to suitable applicants following initial contact.\r\n\r\n**Viewings are strictly by appointment.**",
